Loki stores labels

Unlike Elasticsearch,

Loki stores

namespace=default

pod=java-app

container=java

level=INFO

These labels make searching efficient.


Search examples

Show logs from Java app

{app="java-app"}

Show only default namespace

{namespace="default"}

Show errors

{app="java-app"} |= "ERROR"

This query language is called LogQL.
